  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nThis recipe is built around muted, understated tones, with slightly deeper shadows and soft, gentle highlights. While keeping saturation low, it retains enough color to bring out the character of both light and shadow. The result is a subtle sense of lingering atmosphere, even in the most ordinary everyday moments. It works especially well for photographing cats indoors, as well as scenes where light and shadow take center stage, such as at dusk.",
